## Automated User Provisioning

The lab users were created using PowerShell rather than manually creating each account through Active Directory Users and Computers.

The provisioning script defines each user's:

- Name
- Username
- Department
- Organizational Unit
- User Principal Name
- Initial account configuration

The script then constructs the appropriate OU distinguished name and creates the user using Active Directory PowerShell commands.

Automating account creation makes the environment reproducible and provides experience managing Active Directory through PowerShell.

> Credentials and passwords used by the lab are intentionally excluded from this repository.

