## DNS Architecture

Active Directory-integrated DNS is provided by DC01.

Domain-joined systems use:

```text
10.20.0.50
```

as their DNS server.

This allows systems to resolve the `cyberlab.test` domain and locate Active Directory services.

The basic resolution path is:

```text
Domain Client
     |
     v
DC01 / Active Directory DNS
     |
     v
DNS Forwarder
     |
     v
External DNS
```

This allows DC01 to resolve internal domain records while forwarding external DNS requests when necessary.

